## DNSZone/zoneName without trailing dot
{
  "error": {
    "key": "invalid",
    "message": "DNSZone.kudurru.io \"home-example-com\" is invalid: spec.zoneName: Invalid value: \"home.example.com\": spec.zoneName in body should match '^([a-zA-Z0-9_-]+\\.)*$|^\\.$'",
    "hint": "fix the listed fields and retry: spec.zoneName",
    "fields": [
      "spec.zoneName"
    ]
  }
}

